      "validation": []
    },
    {
      "description": "",
      "fabric": [],
      "file": "",
      "focus": [
        "No lock file is committed: never add package-lock.json, npm-shrinkwrap.json or yarn.lock.",
        "A test-only addition goes in test/<object>.<member>.js (unit) or test/acceptance/<example>.js (acceptance test for examples/<example>)."
      ],
      "mayCommit": false,
      "modelSet": "heavy",
      "name": "plan-chore",
      "output": "path",
      "relevant": [],
      "template": "plan-chore",
      "validation": [
        "lint",
        "test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "",
      "fabric": [],
      "file": "",
      "focus": [
        "The regression test goes in the existing test/<object>.<member>.js for the affected member (test/res.send.js for res.send in lib/response.js); create that file if absent.",
        "Tests are mocha describe/it blocks issuing HTTP requests with supertest; the outer describe names the object (res), the inner one the member (.send()).",
        "Code must run on every Node.js version from 18 and must not create global variables: mocha runs with --check-leaks."
      ],
      "mayCommit": false,
      "modelSet": "heavy",
      "name": "plan-bug",
      "output": "path",
      "relevant": [],
      "template": "plan-bug",
      "validation": [
        "lint",
        "test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "",
      "fabric": [],
      "file": "",
      "focus": [
        "A new member of lib/response.js, lib/request.js or lib/application.js gets its tests in test/res.<member>.js, test/req.<member>.js or test/app.<member>.js.",
        "State the user-visible change as a public API signature or the HTTP response (status, headers, body) an application produces.",
        "The global Buffer is forbidden; take Buffer from the node:buffer module.",
        "Code must run on every Node.js version from 18 and must not create global variables: mocha runs with --check-leaks."
      ],
      "mayCommit": false,
      "modelSet": "heavy",
      "name": "plan-feature",
      "output": "path",
      "relevant": [],
      "template": "plan-feature",
      "validation": [
        "lint",
        "test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "",
      "fabric": [],
      "file": "",
      "focus": [],
      "mayCommit": false,
      "modelSet": "heavy",
      "name": "plan-patch",
      "output": "path",
      "relevant": [],
      "template": "plan-patch",
      "validation": [
        "lint",
        "test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "description": "",
      "fabric": [],
      "file": "",
      "focus": [
        "JavaScript is indented with 2 spaces, files end with a newline, no trailing whitespace, comparisons use === except == null, no unused variables."
      ],
      "mayCommit": false,
      "modelSet": "heavy",
      "name": "resolve-test",
      "output": "text",
      "relevant": [],
      "template": "resolve-test",
      "validation": []
    },
    {
      "description": "",
      "fabric": [],
      "file": "",
      "focus": [
        "The proof is the mocha spec output in the test log: the names of the tests covering the change and the pass count must be present.",
        "A bug fix or feature without a test in test/<object>.<member>.js for the changed member is a blocker.",
        "A change under .github, LICENSE or .npmrc is a blocker for a human."
